  << /ActualText (I\047m a UX Designer at Onething Design\054 working across end\055to\055end product design for web and mobile\056 My process starts with understanding people through research\054 interviews\054 and competitive analysis before moving into wireframes\054 prototypes\054 and high\055fidelity UI in Figma\056 I believe good design has to work for users and make sense for the business at the same time\054 and that\047s the balance I bring to every project\056 I\047m drawn to products that solve real\054 meaningful problems and care deeply about the thinking behind every design decision\056)
